{title: Tumhe Jo Maine Dekha}
{artist: Main Hoon Na Abhijeet Anu Malik}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm]Tum bhee ho, [A]mai bhee hu,
[G]paas aao, [A]toh keh du
[F#]Aakhir kyun pal me yun
[G]diwana [A]mai [Bm]ho gaya
[A]Tumhe jo maine dekha,
[Bm]tumhe jo maine jana
[F#]Jo hosh tha, [B]woh toh gaya
[B]Badan kee yeh khushbu, [A]jatane lagee jadu
[G]Toh hoke bekabu, [F#]dil kho gaya
[A]Tumhe jo maine socha, [Bm]tumhe jo maine mana
[A]Tumhe jo maine dekha, [Bm]tumhe jo maine jana
[F#]Jo hosh tha, [Bm]woh toh gaya
[Bm]Itni kyun [G]tum khubsurat ho,
[A]ke sab ko hairat ho Duneeya me
[E]sachmuch hi rehati hai Pariyo se bhi jyada
[G]pyaree [A]see [Bm]ladki [F#]koi
[Bm]Han itanee kyun, [G]bolo hasin tum ho,
[A]jo dekhe gum sum ho Dekho na
[E]mai bhee hu khoya sa Behka sa mujhpe bhee
[G]chhayi [A]hai [Bm]diwangee
[A]Tumhee ko maine puja, [Bm]tumhee ko chaha pana
[A]Tumhe jo maine dekha, [Bm]tumhe jo maine jana
[F#]Jo hosh tha, [Bm]woh toh gaya
[B]Badan kee yeh khushbu....
